STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:4%; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">(j) The undersigned understands that: (i) it may not be possible to readily liquidate an investment in the Company; (ii) there is no
